---@field code? gcp.unstable.container_v1beta1.StatusConditionCodeEnum|string Machine-friendly representation of the condition Deprecated. Use canonical_code instead.
---@field canonicalCode? gcp.unstable.container_v1beta1.StatusConditionCanonicalCodeEnum|string Canonical code of the condition.

