---UpgradeDetails contains detailed information of each individual upgrade operation.
---@class gcp.unstable.container_v1beta1.UpgradeDetails
---@field initialEmulatedVersion? string The emulated version before the upgrade.
---@field targetVersion? string The version after the upgrade.
---@field startType? gcp.unstable.container_v1beta1.UpgradeDetailsStartTypeEnum The start type of the upgrade.
